  (unicode U+02D9)  (unicode U+00AA)  (unicode U+00BA)  (unicode U+2116)  XX  (unicode U+00B7)  (unicode U+00A3)  (unicode U+00A4)  tab  (unicode U+002F)  S-8  (unicode U+002D)  (unicode U+00A8)  _
